Rule 5 (index tensor (v_2) should be within the range of input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= min(v_2) ≥ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : max(v_2) ≤ shape(v_1, i) − 1

Rule 16 (shape alignment for matrix multiplication)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) − 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) − 2)) ∨ (ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) − 1) = shape(v_2, 0))

